<title>BELGIUM: Swedish SDP leadership view on EMU seen in June.</title>
<headline>Swedish SDP leadership view on EMU seen in June.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The leadership of Sweden's ruling Social Democratic Party is expected to make its recommendation in June on whether the country should join EMU, Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe it will happen before the summer break, in June sometime,&quot; he said in response to a question.</p>
<p>The recommendation will be made to an extraordinary party congress which will decide on the issue in September, followed by a parliament decision later in the autumn.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
